--TEST--
a cursor on an `array<mixed>` annotation whose initializer is a constant declared in another file is offered nothing, because the action reads only an array literal written in the declaration, `rule:ide/the-action-answers-from-the-literal-or-not-at-all`
--FILE--
<?nvs
require 'lib/config.nvs';

array<mi<|>xed> $rows = Config::ROWS;
--FILE lib/config.nvs--
<?nvs
class Config {
    public const array<int> ROWS = [1, 2, 3];
}
--REQUEST--
codeAction
--EXPECT--
none
